## 8. Gotchas

| # | Problem | Symptom | Fix |
|---|---|---|---|
| 1 | Short-lived step pods drop spans | Asset spans randomly missing | `force_flush()` at op end; `OTEL_BSP_SCHEDULE_DELAY=1000`; `terminationGracePeriodSeconds: 30` |
| 2 | Multiprocess executor forks | Only the first op emits spans | Call the `lru_cache`d `init_otel()` inside each op, not at module import |
| 3 | `run_id` as a metric label | Prometheus/Mimir OOM, backend bill spikes | run_id on spans only; strip from metrics in the Collector |
| 4 | SQLAlchemy spans flood everything | 5000+ spans per run | `OTEL_PYTHON_DISABLED_INSTRUMENTATIONS=sqlalchemy,psycopg2` |
| 5 | Run pods have no OTel env | Daemon/webserver traced, runs completely dark | Run pods do **not** inherit chart-level env — configure `runLauncher.config.k8sRunLauncher.envVars` separately |
| 6 | Operator injection misses run pods | Annotation set but nothing injected | Run pods are created at runtime — annotate via `runK8sConfig.podTemplateSpecMetadata` |
| 7 | Manually-triggered runs are orphan traces | Some traces have no sensor parent | Expected. `extract_parent_context` returns `None` and you get a root span |
| 8 | `dagster/` tag prefix rejected | Tag write fails or is dropped | Reserved namespace — use `otel/traceparent` |
| 9 | `inject_into_tags()` returns `{}` in a sensor | Traces never link up | Generator suspension — call it inside the span, before yielding, and reuse the result |
| 10 | Half-sampled traces | Trace exists but is missing branches | Daemon `always_on`, everything downstream `parentbased_traceidratio` |
| 11 | OTLP port confusion | Silent data loss | gRPC = 4317 (bare endpoint); HTTP = 4318 (SDK appends `/v1/traces`) |
| 12 | `context.run.tags` missing on asset checks | AttributeError | Asset check contexts differ — guard with `hasattr` |

